<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A6" title="In Appendix ‣ Provably Mitigating Corruption, Overoptimization, and Verbosity Simultaneously in Offline and Online RLHF/DPO Alignment" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">F </span>Proof of Theorem <span class="ltx_ref"></span></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A7" title="In Appendix ‣ Provably Mitigating Corruption, Overoptimization, and Verbosity Simultaneously in Offline and Online RLHF/DPO Alignment" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">G </span>Proof of Theorem <span class="ltx_ref"></span></span></a></li>
</ol></li>
