<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex60.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle 6\epsilon+\frac{2}{N}\Big[\|\xi^{*}\|_{1}+\log\Big(\frac{|\mathcal{N}_{\epsilon}(\mathcal{R})|}{\delta}\Big)\Big]-\frac{E_{r^{{\dagger}}}^{2}-E_{r}^{2}}{2(3+e^{R})^{2}}-\frac{E_{r}^{2}}{2(3+e^{R})^{2}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">[</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msup><mi>ξ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mi>ϵ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mi>δ</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mi>E</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mo>†</mo></msup><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>E</mi><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>R</mi></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msubsup><mi>E</mi><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>R</mi></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle 6\epsilon+\frac{2}{N}\Big[\|\xi^{*}\|_{1}+\log\Big(\frac{|\mathcal{N}_{\epsilon}(\mathcal{R})|}{\delta}\Big)\Big]-\frac{E_{r^{{\dagger}}}^{2}-E_{r}^{2}}{2(3+e^{R})^{2}}-\frac{E_{r}^{2}}{2(3+e^{R})^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
