</table>
<p id="A2.p13.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p13.4.1" class="ltx_text">where (a) uses Assumption <a href="#Thmassum2" title="Assumption 2 (Realizable and Bounded Reward ( , )). ‣ 3.3 Generalization Analysis of Offline DPO-COV ‣ 3 Our Offline DPO-COV Algorithm ‣ Provably Mitigating Corruption, Overoptimization, and Verbosity Simultaneously in Offline and Online RLHF/DPO Alignment" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> and <math id="A2.p13.m22" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|r^{{\dagger}}-r\|_{\infty}\leq\epsilon" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mo>†</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|r^{{\dagger}}-r\|_{\infty}\leq\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math>.
∎</span></p>
