<div id="Thmlemma9" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lemma">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmlemma9.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma 9</span></span><span id="Thmlemma9.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="Thmlemma9.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Thmlemma9.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmlemma9.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Fixing any <math id="Thmlemma9.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\epsilon&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\epsilon&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="Thmlemma9.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta\in(0,1)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta\in(0,1)</annotation></semantics></math>, the online dataset <math id="Thmlemma9.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{x_{i},a_{i}^{w},a_{i}^{\ell},y_{i}\}_{i=1}^{T}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>w</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{x_{i},a_{i}^{w},a_{i}^{\ell},y_{i}\}_{i=1}^{T}</annotation></semantics></math> generated from Algorithm <a href="#alg2" title="Algorithm 2 ‣ 4 Our Online DPO-COV Algorithm ‣ Provably Mitigating Corruption, Overoptimization, and Verbosity Simultaneously in Offline and Online RLHF/DPO Alignment" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> satisfies the following bound for all <math id="Thmlemma9.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t=1,\ldots,T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t=1,\ldots,T</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="Thmlemma9.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi\in\Pi_{\mathcal{R}}\overset{\rm def}{=}\{\pi_{r}:r\in\mathcal{R}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Π</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mo>=</mo><mo mathsize="0.700em">def</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi\in\Pi_{\mathcal{R}}\overset{\rm def}{=}\{\pi_{r}:r\in\mathcal{R}\}</annotation></semantics></math> simultaneously with probability at least <math id="Thmlemma9.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1-\delta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1-\delta</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
<table id="A2.EGx56" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex68"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex68.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\sum_{i=1}^{t}\log\frac{\sigma\big[r^{\pi}(x_{i},a_{i}^{w})-r^{\pi}(x_{i},a_{i}^{\ell})+y_{i}\xi_{i}^{\pi}\big]}{\sigma\big[r^{*}(x_{i},a_{i}^{w})-r^{*}(x_{i},a_{i}^{\ell})+y_{i}\xi_{i}^{*}\big]}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mi>π</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>w</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mi>π</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>ξ</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>π</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>w</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>ξ</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\sum_{i=1}^{t}\log\frac{\sigma\big[r^{\pi}(x_{i},a_{i}^{w})-r^{\pi}(x_{i},a_{i}^{\ell})+y_{i}\xi_{i}^{\pi}\big]}{\sigma\big[r^{*}(x_{i},a_{i}^{w})-r^{*}(x_{i},a_{i}^{\ell})+y_{i}\xi_{i}^{*}\big]}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex69"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex69.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>≤</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex69.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle 2\log\Big(\frac{T|\mathcal{N}_{\epsilon}(\mathcal{R})|}{\delta}\Big)+4t\epsilon+\sum_{i=1}^{t}\Big\{\frac{1}{4}|\xi_{i}^{*}|+\sigma(R)|\xi_{i}^{\pi}|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>log</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mi>ϵ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow><mi>δ</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>t</mi><mi>ϵ</mi><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msubsup><mi>ξ</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo fence="false" stretchy="false">|</mo><mo lspace="0em">+</mo><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msubsup><mi>ξ</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>π</mi></msubsup><mo fence="false" stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle 2\log\Big(\frac{T|\mathcal{N}_{\epsilon}(\mathcal{R})|}{\delta}\Big)+4t\epsilon+\sum_{i=1}^{t}\Big\{\frac{1}{4}|\xi_{i}^{*}|+\sigma(R)|\xi_{i}^{\pi}|</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex70"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex70.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle-\frac{1}{2(3+e^{R})^{2}}\mathbb{E}_{x\sim\rho,a^{(1)}\sim\pi_{i}(\cdot|x),a^{(-1)}\sim\pi_{\rm ref}(\cdot|x)}\big[f_{\pi}^{2}(x,a^{(1)},a^{(-1)})\big]\Big\}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>R</mi></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∼</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>∼</mo><mi>π</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>∼</mo><mi>π</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>ref</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">[</mo><msubsup><mi>f</mi><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">]</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle-\frac{1}{2(3+e^{R})^{2}}\mathbb{E}_{x\sim\rho,a^{(1)}\sim\pi_{i}(\cdot|x),a^{(-1)}\sim\pi_{\rm ref}(\cdot|x)}\big[f_{\pi}^{2}(x,a^{(1)},a^{(-1)})\big]\Big\},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Thmlemma9.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmlemma9.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">where the function <math id="Thmlemma9.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f_{\pi}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>π</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f_{\pi}</annotation></semantics></math> is defined below and <math id="Thmlemma9.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{N}_{\epsilon}(\mathcal{R})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mi>ϵ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{N}_{\epsilon}(\mathcal{R})</annotation></semantics></math> is a finite <math id="Thmlemma9.p1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\epsilon" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>ϵ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math>-cover of <math id="Thmlemma9.p1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{R}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{R}</annotation></semantics></math>, that is, for any <math id="Thmlemma9.p1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r\in\mathcal{R}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r\in\mathcal{R}</annotation></semantics></math>, there exists <math id="Thmlemma9.p1.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r^{{\dagger}}\in\mathcal{N}_{\epsilon}(\mathcal{R})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mo>†</mo></msup><mo>∈</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mi>ϵ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r^{{\dagger}}\in\mathcal{N}_{\epsilon}(\mathcal{R})</annotation></semantics></math> satisfying <math id="Thmlemma9.p1.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|r^{{\dagger}}-r\|_{\infty}\leq\epsilon" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mo>†</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|r^{{\dagger}}-r\|_{\infty}\leq\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
<table id="A2.EGx57" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.E46"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E46.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle f_{\pi}(x,a^{(1)},a^{(-1)})\overset{\rm def}{=}r^{*}(x,a^{(1)})-r^{*}(x,a^{(-1)})-r^{\pi}(x,a^{(1)})+r^{\pi}(x,a^{(-1)})," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>π</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mo>=</mo><mo mathsize="0.700em">def</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mi>π</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mi>π</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle f_{\pi}(x,a^{(1)},a^{(-1)})\overset{\rm def}{=}r^{*}(x,a^{(1)})-r^{*}(x,a^{(-1)})-r^{\pi}(x,a^{(1)})+r^{\pi}(x,a^{(-1)}),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(46)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A2.9" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A2.p14" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.p14.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p14.1.1" class="ltx_text">Define the following function.</span></p>
<table id="A2.EGx58" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex71"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex71.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle q_{\pi,\xi_{i}}(y_{i}|x_{i},a_{i}^{(1)},a_{i}^{(-1)})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>ξ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle q_{\pi,\xi_{i}}(y_{i}|x_{i},a_{i}^{(1)},a_{i}^{(-1)})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex72"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex72.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\overset{\rm def}{=}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mo>=</mo><mo mathsize="0.700em">def</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\overset{\rm def}{=}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex72.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\begin{cases}\sigma\Big(\beta\log\frac{\pi(a_{i}^{(1)}|x_{i})}{\pi_{\rm ref}(a_{i}^{(1)}|x_{i})}-\beta\log\frac{\pi(a_{i}^{(-1)}|x_{i})}{\pi_{\rm ref}(a_{i}^{(-1)}|x_{i})}+\omega(|a_{i}^{(1)}|-|a_{i}^{(-1)}|)+\xi_{i}\Big),&amp;y_{i}=1\\
\sigma\Big(\beta\log\frac{\pi(a_{i}^{(-1)}|x_{i})}{\pi_{\rm ref}(a_{i}^{(-1)}|x_{i})}-\beta\log\frac{\pi(a_{i}^{(1)}|x_{i})}{\pi_{\rm ref}(a_{i}^{(1)}|x_{i})}+\omega(|a_{i}^{(-1)}|-|a_{i}^{(1)}|)-\xi_{i}\Big),&amp;y_{i}=-1.\end{cases}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>{</mo><mtable columnspacing="5pt" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>ref</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>ref</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>ω</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>ξ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>ref</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>ref</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>ω</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>ξ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\begin{cases}\sigma\Big(\beta\log\frac{\pi(a_{i}^{(1)}|x_{i})}{\pi_{\rm ref}(a_{i}^{(1)}|x_{i})}-\beta\log\frac{\pi(a_{i}^{(-1)}|x_{i})}{\pi_{\rm ref}(a_{i}^{(-1)}|x_{i})}+\omega(|a_{i}^{(1)}|-|a_{i}^{(-1)}|)+\xi_{i}\Big),&amp;y_{i}=1\\
\sigma\Big(\beta\log\frac{\pi(a_{i}^{(-1)}|x_{i})}{\pi_{\rm ref}(a_{i}^{(-1)}|x_{i})}-\beta\log\frac{\pi(a_{i}^{(1)}|x_{i})}{\pi_{\rm ref}(a_{i}^{(1)}|x_{i})}+\omega(|a_{i}^{(-1)}|-|a_{i}^{(1)}|)-\xi_{i}\Big),&amp;y_{i}=-1.\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.E47"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E47.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>=</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E47.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\sigma\big[r^{\pi}(x_{i},a_{i}^{w})-r^{\pi}(x_{i},a_{i}^{\ell})+y_{i}\xi_{i}\big]," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mi>π</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>w</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mi>π</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>ξ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\sigma\big[r^{\pi}(x_{i},a_{i}^{w})-r^{\pi}(x_{i},a_{i}^{\ell})+y_{i}\xi_{i}\big],</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(47)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.p14.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p14.2.1" class="ltx_text">where the second <math id="A2.p14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>=</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">=</annotation></semantics></math> uses Eq. (<a href="#S3.E16" title="Equation 16 ‣ 3.2 Our Offline DPO-COV Algorithm ‣ 3 Our Offline DPO-COV Algorithm ‣ Provably Mitigating Corruption, Overoptimization, and Verbosity Simultaneously in Offline and Online RLHF/DPO Alignment" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">16</span></a>) and merges the above two cases. The above <math id="A2.p14.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q_{\pi,\xi_{i}}(y_{i}|x_{i},a_{i}^{(1)},a_{i}^{(-1)})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>ξ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q_{\pi,\xi_{i}}(y_{i}|x_{i},a_{i}^{(1)},a_{i}^{(-1)})</annotation></semantics></math> can be seen as a conditional probability of <math id="A2.p14.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y_{i}\in\{-1,1\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y_{i}\in\{-1,1\}</annotation></semantics></math> since <math id="A2.p14.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q_{\pi,\xi_{i}}(1|x_{i},a_{i}^{(1)},a_{i}^{(-1)})+q_{\pi,\xi_{i}}(-1|x_{i},a_{i}^{(1)},a_{i}^{(-1)})=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>ξ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>ξ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q_{\pi,\xi_{i}}(1|x_{i},a_{i}^{(1)},a_{i}^{(-1)})+q_{\pi,\xi_{i}}(-1|x_{i},a_{i}^{(1)},a_{i}^{(-1)})=1</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A2.p15" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.p15.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p15.1.1" class="ltx_text">Then define the following random variables for <math id="A2.p15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i=1,\ldots,T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i=1,\ldots,T</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
<table id="A2.EGx59" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.E48"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E48.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle W_{i}(\pi)=\frac{1}{2}\log\frac{\sigma\big[r^{\pi}(x_{i},a_{i}^{w})-r^{\pi}(x_{i},a_{i}^{\ell})\big]}{\sigma\big[r^{*}(x_{i},a_{i}^{w})-r^{*}(x_{i},a_{i}^{\ell})+y_{i}\xi_{i}^{*}\big]}=\frac{1}{2}\log\frac{q_{\pi,0}(y_{i}|x_{i},a_{i}^{(1)},a_{i}^{(-1)})}{p_{r^{*},\xi_{i}^{*}}(y_{i}|x_{i},a_{i}^{(1)},a_{i}^{(-1)})}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">[</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mi>π</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>w</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mi>π</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>w</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>ξ</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>ξ</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle W_{i}(\pi)=\frac{1}{2}\log\frac{\sigma\big[r^{\pi}(x_{i},a_{i}^{w})-r^{\pi}(x_{i},a_{i}^{\ell})\big]}{\sigma\big[r^{*}(x_{i},a_{i}^{w})-r^{*}(x_{i},a_{i}^{\ell})+y_{i}\xi_{i}^{*}\big]}=\frac{1}{2}\log\frac{q_{\pi,0}(y_{i}|x_{i},a_{i}^{(1)},a_{i}^{(-1)})}{p_{r^{*},\xi_{i}^{*}}(y_{i}|x_{i},a_{i}^{(1)},a_{i}^{(-1)})},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(48)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.p15.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p15.2.1" class="ltx_text">where <math id="A2.p15.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{r,\xi_{i}}(y_{i}|x_{i},a_{i}^{(1)},a_{i}^{(-1)})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>ξ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{r,\xi_{i}}(y_{i}|x_{i},a_{i}^{(1)},a_{i}^{(-1)})</annotation></semantics></math> is defined by Eq. (<a href="#A2.E41" title="Equation 41 ‣ Proof. ‣ Appendix B Supporting Lemmas ‣ Appendix ‣ Provably Mitigating Corruption, Overoptimization, and Verbosity Simultaneously in Offline and Online RLHF/DPO Alignment" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">41</span></a>).</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A2.p16" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.p16.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p16.1.1" class="ltx_text">For any <math id="A2.p16.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r\in\mathcal{R}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r\in\mathcal{R}</annotation></semantics></math>, there exists <math id="A2.p16.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r^{{\dagger}}\in\mathcal{N}_{\epsilon}(\mathcal{R})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mo>†</mo></msup><mo>∈</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mi>ϵ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r^{{\dagger}}\in\mathcal{N}_{\epsilon}(\mathcal{R})</annotation></semantics></math> satisfying <math id="A2.p16.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|r^{{\dagger}}-r\|_{\infty}\leq\epsilon" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mo>†</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|r^{{\dagger}}-r\|_{\infty}\leq\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math>, and thus we can temporarily denote <math id="A2.p16.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r_{u}=ur^{\pi_{r^{{\dagger}}}}+(1-u)r^{\pi}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>u</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><msub><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mo>†</mo></msup></msub></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>u</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mi>π</mi></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r_{u}=ur^{\pi_{r^{{\dagger}}}}+(1-u)r^{\pi}</annotation></semantics></math> (<math id="A2.p16.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u\in[0,1]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u\in[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math>). Then we obtain that</span></p>
<table id="A2.EGx60" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex73"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex73.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\Big|\frac{d}{du}\log\sigma\big[r_{u}(x_{i},a_{i}^{w})-r_{u}(x_{i},a_{i}^{\ell})\big]\Big|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em" stretchy="true">|</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">[</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>u</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>w</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>u</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em" stretchy="true">|</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\Big|\frac{d}{du}\log\sigma\big[r_{u}(x_{i},a_{i}^{w})-r_{u}(x_{i},a_{i}^{\ell})\big]\Big|</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex74"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex74.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>=</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex74.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\sigma\big[r_{u}(x_{i},a_{i}^{\ell})-r_{u}(x_{i},a_{i}^{w})\big]\big|r^{\pi_{r^{{\dagger}}}}(x_{i},a_{i}^{w})-r^{\pi_{r^{{\dagger}}}}(x_{i},a_{i}^{\ell})-r^{\pi}(x_{i},a_{i}^{w})+r^{\pi}(x_{i},a_{i}^{\ell})\big|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">[</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>u</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>u</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>w</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em" stretchy="true">|</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><msub><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mo>†</mo></msup></msub></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>w</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><msub><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mo>†</mo></msup></msub></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mi>π</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>w</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mi>π</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em" stretchy="true">|</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\sigma\big[r_{u}(x_{i},a_{i}^{\ell})-r_{u}(x_{i},a_{i}^{w})\big]\big|r^{\pi_{r^{{\dagger}}}}(x_{i},a_{i}^{w})-r^{\pi_{r^{{\dagger}}}}(x_{i},a_{i}^{\ell})-r^{\pi}(x_{i},a_{i}^{w})+r^{\pi}(x_{i},a_{i}^{\ell})\big|</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex75"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex75.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\overset{(a)}{\leq}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.700em" minsize="0.700em">(</mo><mi mathsize="0.700em">a</mi><mo maxsize="0.700em" minsize="0.700em">)</mo></mrow></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\overset{(a)}{\leq}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex75.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\big|r^{{\dagger}}(x_{i},a_{i}^{w})-r^{{\dagger}}(x_{i},a_{i}^{\ell})-r^{\pi}(x_{i},a_{i}^{w})+r^{\pi}(x_{i},a_{i}^{\ell})\big|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em" stretchy="true">|</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mo>†</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>w</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mo>†</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mi>π</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>w</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mi>π</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em" stretchy="true">|</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\big|r^{{\dagger}}(x_{i},a_{i}^{w})-r^{{\dagger}}(x_{i},a_{i}^{\ell})-r^{\pi}(x_{i},a_{i}^{w})+r^{\pi}(x_{i},a_{i}^{\ell})\big|</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.E49"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E49.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>≤</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E49.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\big|r^{{\dagger}}(x_{i},a_{i}^{w})-r^{\pi}(x_{i},a_{i}^{w})\big|+\big|r^{\pi}(x_{i},a_{i}^{\ell})-r^{{\dagger}}(x_{i},a_{i}^{\ell})\big|\leq 2\epsilon," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em" stretchy="true">|</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mo>†</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>w</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mi>π</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>w</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em" stretchy="true">|</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em" stretchy="true">|</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mi>π</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mo>†</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em" stretchy="true">|</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\big|r^{{\dagger}}(x_{i},a_{i}^{w})-r^{\pi}(x_{i},a_{i}^{w})\big|+\big|r^{\pi}(x_{i},a_{i}^{\ell})-r^{{\dagger}}(x_{i},a_{i}^{\ell})\big|\leq 2\epsilon,</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(49)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.p16.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p16.2.1" class="ltx_text">where (a) uses Eq. (<a href="#A2.E29" title="Equation 29 ‣ Lemma 2. ‣ Appendix B Supporting Lemmas ‣ Appendix ‣ Provably Mitigating Corruption, Overoptimization, and Verbosity Simultaneously in Offline and Online RLHF/DPO Alignment" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">29</span></a>) and <math id="A2.p16.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sigma(x)\in(0,1)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sigma(x)\in(0,1)</annotation></semantics></math> for any <math id="A2.p16.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x\in\mathbb{R}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℝ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x\in\mathbb{R}</annotation></semantics></math>. Therefore,</span></p>
<table id="A2.EGx61" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

