<tbody id="A2.E52"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E52.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle+\log\Big(\frac{T|\mathcal{N}_{\epsilon}(\mathcal{R})|}{\delta}\Big)+2t\epsilon," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">+</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mi>ϵ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow><mi>δ</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle+\log\Big(\frac{T|\mathcal{N}_{\epsilon}(\mathcal{R})|}{\delta}\Big)+2t\epsilon,</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(52)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.p16.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p16.6.1" class="ltx_text">where (a) uses Eq. (<a href="#A2.E51" title="Equation 51 ‣ Proof. ‣ Appendix B Supporting Lemmas ‣ Appendix ‣ Provably Mitigating Corruption, Overoptimization, and Verbosity Simultaneously in Offline and Online RLHF/DPO Alignment" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">51</span></a>) (with <math id="A2.p16.m27" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi^{\prime}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>π</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi^{\prime}</annotation></semantics></math> replaced by <math id="A2.p16.m28" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi_{r^{{\dagger}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mo>†</mo></msup></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi_{r^{{\dagger}}}</annotation></semantics></math>) and Eq. (<a href="#A2.E50" title="Equation 50 ‣ Proof. ‣ Appendix B Supporting Lemmas ‣ Appendix ‣ Provably Mitigating Corruption, Overoptimization, and Verbosity Simultaneously in Offline and Online RLHF/DPO Alignment" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">50</span></a>), (b) uses the following inequality and <math id="A2.p16.m29" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(3+e^{R})^{2}&gt;6e^{R}+e^{2R}&gt;6R+2R=8R" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>R</mi></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&gt;</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>R</mi></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(3+e^{R})^{2}&gt;6e^{R}+e^{2R}&gt;6R+2R=8R</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
